{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411020","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1341102001:1":{"text":"フェルガルドさん、祭典が終わった後も、スノーシダー町に残るんですか？","source_cn":"法拉莫尔先生，祭典结束以后，你会一直留在雪松镇吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D7A5BF14315E90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1341102002:1":{"text":"暫くはいるかもしれないが、定住するつもりはない。グレイヴボーンハンターとして、私にはまだやることがたくさんあるからな。","source_cn":"或许会小住一段时间。但我不会定居在这里，作为亡灵猎人，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B1C6EFAEB2B0C9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341102003:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーンハンターというのは、組織みたいなものですか？","source_cn":"亡灵猎人也是一个组织吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C3D93B71A952097","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341102004:1":{"text":"ああ、数十名の小さな組織だ。ブライト王国の者がほとんどで、私のようなヴェルディア人はごくわずかしかいない。","source_cn":"我们只有几十个成员，大部分都来自耀光帝国，我是加入组织...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2452416369A9D3EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341102005:1":{"text":"グレイヴボーンを狩るのが組織の目的なんですか？","source_cn":"你们的目标就是狩猎亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DACC9C5DF056396","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","doc